        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You have done some user interviews and some state-of-the-art research. ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b682a595-d6a0-4145-ab74-80205e8d4b78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now you will define your user, map their journey, and choose a HMW question. ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dce88e63-9a78-4e4e-b5dd-2d7c07ce9fbf",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "From there, you will brainstorm a wide array of options for solutions and sketch some possibilities.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "79e8dbed-b192-4ea4-bcff-e164c98b2a11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Trust the process; these defining and sketching steps prepare you for creating a testable prototype.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
