    {
      "id": "ecb66b02-f44d-4430-94ca-a8cf18ff2f1c",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Part 1:  Define (as a team)",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b6822108-0685-49cb-922f-7bec73fdb816",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User Persona",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "d71f8ec5-df7e-44d9-b62a-42cfa4f4f5ad",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Create a User Persona that focuses on the needs you observed in your interviews. This Persona should generalize a specific user or a compilation from a couple of your interviews.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "4641affa-514d-4f9c-becd-fe0f94b9432a",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don’t name them or give them an image - instead, focus on their experiential traits as a way to minimize bias. A good title is one that describes these traits, such as “The Overworked Educator” or “The Gardening Grandma.”",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "6c42dc4f-64da-421e-8574-a8481d789954",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Dimensions of Difference section pulls out the most memorable traits of the user (e.g. they like to plan every detail in advance vs. they like to be totally spontaneous.)",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "95a86a0b-dcc1-41cf-a91c-1026f06ca858",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Write out a paragraph for this persona based on your interviews. Use primary quotes and details. Remember it’s ok to blend a few different interviews together to get a full picture.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b4f66f2a-8c14-41b9-99d2-d6d57ce028b9",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User Journey Map",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e38dd311-dd15-4841-b4a5-1eb90072ed12",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "With your Persona in mind, be as specific as possible as you map out their current journey to achieve their goal.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "fec45fa4-655c-410f-b2df-ad9080dbfbb7",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Include the full range of actions: from preparation to the conclusion.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "a0680907-a6d7-42fe-ad83-183715c6139a",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Identify places in the user journey where their feelings dipped below baseline (a poached experience) and where their expectations were exceeded (an enriched experience).",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "b659aba8-9433-4fb6-804b-835d67fdbb6d",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Note the opportunities - these are areas you believe a digital tool might help.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1aaa0279-e4c9-4535-92d2-19b317008359",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How Might We Questions",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "45440235-8dde-4c24-aebb-f2a53cb5df0b",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Write down 2 HMW questions each.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "7ac5857e-6bad-4ad7-be52-1f11a4889fd9",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Follow ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://designsprintkit.withgoogle.com/methodology/phase1-understand/hmw-voting/generate-a-broad-range-of-solutions-to-a-small-challenge",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "these directions on dot voting",
                  "styles": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " to select the best HMW question for your team to focus on.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ab162ff5-c2d5-4048-8521-24a08d61b7b2",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you think the chosen HMW could use some tweaking, work on that together.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "55b09932-93b0-4882-9aa7-9fbc0540889a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
