    {
      "id": "89c696ee-2dc2-4556-a570-97c514625e57",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Part 2:",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "  Ideate (as a team)",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b20daa40-9b0b-45b2-9a8a-1d89280ecaf8",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Brainstorm",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "d3f34fdf-e8c8-4e3e-83b3-2c72029b1afc",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a team, brainstorm a variety of digital solutions to the selected HMW question.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c74a2eae-b01e-4a18-8306-33a08d5a9045",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use any method you prefer as a group. Remember to build on each other’s ideas, focusing on using “and” instead of “but,” and “yes” instead of “no” to encourage each other to keep thinking and contributing.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c4ef04c0-f122-49b5-84cb-05e1fcd9a4aa",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Record the brainstorm. You can audio record as you chat, designate one person as a note taker (please take turns!), use physical Post-Its, or work directly in FigJam (please talk out loud as you work).",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "07923dcd-cfc1-4954-b2c1-5dc6ea9f9110",
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "props": {
                "backgroundColor": "default",
                "textColor": "default",
                "textAlignment": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "However you choose to record your brainstorm, keep it to ",
                  "styles": {}
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "one idea per post-it.",
                  "styles": {
                    "bold": true
                  }
                }
              ],
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3875cac1-432c-4192-9349-1314cd8da2c1",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cluster the ideas by theme.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5e55c6e3-1106-4729-b3af-ed4955268031",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Crazy 8’s",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " (team)",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "cf964df5-a982-4b75-9dd0-91ba6ea287aa",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Follow the Google Sprint technique for ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://designsprintkit.withgoogle.com/methodology/phase3-sketch/crazy-8s",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Crazy 8’s",
                  "styles": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ".",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "94743922-f3bf-498f-b99b-0c967dccb448",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Drawing is a fun part of UX design! It’s an opportunity for brainstorming and finding solutions - don’t worry about how pretty your sketches look. The goal is to visualize your ideas.",
              "styles": {
                "italic": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "d51f452f-ed56-4559-951a-74179979a0f6",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You might try the “thick marker” technique to keep each concept short and sweet.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "2f7c9d40-6805-4b54-9bbf-8e4dd9734011",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Take quality scans or photos and upload them to FigJam.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "56aec9bc-b5e5-4e87-ae6b-cc3e087740e6",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Vote",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " (team)",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
